<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-ignore-a-folder">
    <title>Ignore a folder</title>
    <body>
    <p>To add an untracked folder to a project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>, on <uicontrol
        conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/gs0-git-staging-view"/>, follow
      these steps: <ul id="ol_vtn_kzw_jjc">
        <li>Right-click a folder to open the contextual menu and select <uicontrol
            conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/ignore"/>
          <b>></b>
          <uicontrol conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/ign-dir-0-ignore-dir"/>.<p>
            <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mjc">
              <title>Ignoring a folder</title>
              <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/ignore_directory.png"
                id="image_stw_rzd_mjc"/>
            </fig>
          </p></li>
        <li>Alternatively, select the arrow next to a folder to expand it. Right-click any file in
          the folder to open its contextual menu and select <uicontrol
            conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/ignore"/>
          <b>></b>
          <uicontrol conref="git-staging-uicontrols.dita#git-staging-uicontrols/ignore-parent-dir"
          />.</li>
      </ul></p>
    <p>The untracked folder's path is added to the project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>.</p>
  </body>
</topic>
